{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"24":{"eng-name":"The Chapters on Jihad","ara-name":"كتاب الجهاد"}},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":2753,"hadithnumber_last":2881,"arabicnumber_first":2753,"arabicnumber_last":2881}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2821,"arabicnumber":2821,"text":"Rapporté par Ja’far bin ‘Amr bin Huraith, d’après son père : C’est comme si je voyais le Messager d’Allah (ﷺ), portant un turban noir, avec ses deux extrémités pendantes entre ses épaules","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":69},"chapter":{"id":22,"ara-name":"باب لُبْسِ الْعَمَائِمِ فِي الْحَرْبِ","eng-name":"Wearing turbans during war","isFirstHadith":true}}]}